    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d154">

                <pb facs="0165" n="115" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav03/pg115"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.61321/7</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Consul General at Moscow</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Summers</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-04-04T20:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 4, 1918,
                                8 p.m.</hi></date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your 297, March 30. Can you obtain further details, especially total amount crop
                    and points of shipment in Turkestan?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Lansing</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
